(SKF 6205-2RS Deep Groove Ball Bearing Maintenance and Engineering Manual) Tj T*
(Section 1: Geometric Specifications and Internal Clearance) Tj T*
(The SKF 6205-2RS single-row deep groove ball bearing has a bore diameter of 25.0 mm,) Tj T*
(an outside diameter of 52.0 mm, and a width of 15.0 mm.) Tj T*
(Internal geometry: N = 9 rolling elements \(balls\), ball diameter d = 7.94 mm,) Tj T*
(pitch diameter D = 39.04 mm, and nominal contact angle phi = 0.0 degrees.) Tj T*
(Standard radial internal clearance \(CN\) before mounting is 5 to 20 micrometers,) Tj T*
(while C3 radial internal clearance before mounting is 13 to 28 micrometers.) Tj T*
(At a shaft speed of 1797 RPM \(29.95 Hz\), the theoretical defect frequencies are:) Tj T*
(FTF = 11.93 Hz, BPFO = 107.36 Hz, BPFI = 162.19 Hz, and BSF = 70.58 Hz.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
