(Section 2: Lubrication Intervals, Grease Selection, and Mounting Fits) Tj T*
(For continuous industrial operation at 1500 to 1800 RPM under moderate radial load) Tj T*
(and bearing housing temperatures below 70 degrees C, the recommended relubrication) Tj T*
(interval for open/shielded 6205 bearings is 4500 operating hours using lithium-complex) Tj T*
(ISO VG 100 mineral grease \(fill 30 to 35 percent of free internal space\).) Tj T*
(For sealed 6205-2RS bearings, inspect seals every 2000 hours for grease purging or) Tj T*
(contaminant ingress. Shaft fit tolerance for rotating inner ring loads should be k5) Tj T*
(or m5, and housing bore tolerance for stationary outer ring loads should be H7 or J7.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
